{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7719aa9dc5a833d9e70","chatId":"20f120c6b796419d95461a10591b2de6","sessionId":null,"userId":99625,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1381,"promptTokens":567,"completionTokens":164,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:48:01"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008573957896249096,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7719aa9dc5a833d9e6f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484081099,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:48:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a7719aa9dc5a833d9e6f","chatId":"20f120c6b796419d95461a10591b2de6","sessionId":null,"userId":99625,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n在全班进行物理考试时，老师警告了大家不要作弊，并告知了同学们相关后果。老师去厕所时，整个班级突然开始讨论和对答案。当老师从洗手间回来时，他看到了一个有有序的安静的班级。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，老师最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 钦佩 & 伤心\nB) 钦佩 & 没意识的\nC) 没意识的 & 伤心\nD) 钦佩 & 反对\nE) 反对 & 伤心\nF) 没意识的 & 愧疚\n\n## 问题 2\n老师为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 老师很钦佩学生们的自律，在他不在的时候，他们能保持课堂的安静和有序 & 老师并不了解学生的学业困扰\nB) 老师欣赏学生在他缺席时主导课堂的积极性 & 当老师离开时，无人发言。\nC) 老师很钦佩学生们的自律，在他不在的时候，他们能保持课堂的安静和有序 & 老师不知道学生在他不在的时候作弊\nD) 老师很钦佩学生们的自律，在他不在的时候，他们能保持课堂的安静和有序 & 当老师告诫他们不要作弊时，学生们却在考试中作弊\nE) 老师很钦佩学生们的自律，在他不在的时候，他们能保持课堂的安静和有序 & 当老师离开时，无人发言。\nF) 老师并不了解学生的学业困扰 & 老师欣赏学生在他缺席时主导课堂的积极性","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008573957896249096,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a7719aa9dc5a833d9e70","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484081096,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:48:01","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"bbf6e487cb87471ba5ac3ea4d94c2530"}